# ⭐ Feature 1 — **AI Task Prioritization**

AI will analyze:

* Task title
* Description
* Priority (user-selected)
* Deadline (you already added a `Date` label, good!)

👉 AI can automatically decide:

* Which tasks are most urgent
* Which should be done today
* Which tasks can be postponed

**Example button you can add:**
`Generate Smart Priority`

### Implementation idea:

```javascript
async function generateSmartPriority(task) {
    const response = await fetch("https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions", {
        method: "POST",
        headers: {
            "Content-Type": "application/json",
            "Authorization": `Bearer YOUR_KEY`
        },
        body: JSON.stringify({
            model: "gpt-4.1-mini",
            messages: [{
                role: "user",
                content: `Analyze this task and assign priority (low, medium, high):
                Title: ${task.title}
                Description: ${task.description}
                Deadline: ${task.date}`
            }]
        })
    });

    const result = await response.json();
    return result.choices[0].message.content;
}
```

Then automatically update the priority badge.

